{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多前書","commonName":"哥林多前書","title":"哥林多前書","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"0bb2df52ecc035daf061ff19f8f15532627b064d54d80c5599126c0ead143f8d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["傳揚釘十字架的基督"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄們，從前我到你們那裏去，並沒有用高言大智對你們宣傳上帝的奧祕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為我曾定了主意，在你們中間不知道別的，只知道耶穌基督並他釘十字架。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我在你們那裏，又軟弱，又懼怕又甚戰兢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我說的話、講的道，不是用智慧委婉的言語，乃是用聖靈和大能的明證，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["叫你們的信不在乎人的智慧，只在乎上帝的大能。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝藉着聖靈啟示我們"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["然而，在完全的人中，我們也講智慧。但不是這世上的智慧，也不是這世上有權有位、將要敗亡之人的智慧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我們講的，乃是從前所隱藏、上帝奧祕的智慧，就是上帝在萬世以前預定使我們得榮耀的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這智慧世上有權有位的人沒有一個知道的，他們若知道，就不把榮耀的主釘在十字架上了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如經上所記：",{"text":"上帝為愛他的人所預備的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛未曾看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵未曾聽見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人心也未曾想到的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["只有上帝藉着聖靈向我們顯明了，因為聖靈參透萬事，就是上帝深奧的事也參透了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["除了在人裏頭的靈，誰知道人的事？像這樣，除了上帝的靈，也沒有人知道上帝的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們所領受的，並不是世上的靈，乃是從上帝來的靈，叫我們能知道上帝開恩賜給我們的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["並且我們講說這些事，不是用人智慧所指教的言語，乃是用聖靈所指教的言語，將屬靈的話解釋屬靈的事",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["然而，屬血氣的人不領會上帝聖靈的事，反倒以為愚拙，並且不能知道，因為這些事惟有屬靈的人才能看透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["屬靈的人能看透萬事，卻沒有一人能看透了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["誰曾知道主的心去教導他呢？但我們是有基督的心了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：將屬靈的事講與屬靈的人","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CO/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}